    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "**Stunning 3-Bedroom Apartment with Panoramic Sea Views**\r\n\r\nWatch the sun rise from the balcony.\r\n\r\nExceptional fourth-floor apartment in the prestigious Anchorage complex offering uninterrupted sea views through impressive floor-to-ceiling windows.\r\n\r\nProperty Features:\r\n\r\n- 3 spacious double bedrooms with fitted wardrobes\r\n- 2 well-appointed bathrooms with pumped showers\r\n- Open plan kitchen/diner/living room perfect for entertaining\r\n- Gas fired central heating throughout\r\n- Secure underground parking with allocated car space\r\n- Lift from garage to apartment\r\n\r\nPrime Location:\r\n\r\n- 7 minutes walk from Dun Laoghaire DART Station\r\n- Multiple bus routes nearby\r\n- Walking distance to Seapoint and the Forty Foot swimming spots\r\n- Close to Royal St George and Royal Irish Yacht Clubs\r\n\r\nLocal Amenities:\r\n\r\n- Excellent shopping at Bloomfields and Dun Laoghaire Shopping Centres\r\n- Vibrant dining scene with numerous restaurants and bars\r\n- Entertainment options including IMC Cinema and Pavillion Theatre\r\n- Beautiful coastal walks along the piers\r\n\r\nThis desirable seafront property combines luxury living with exceptional convenience in one of Dun Laoghaire's most sought-after developments."
      },
